{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁמַ֫יִן","hw":"שְׁמַ֫יִן","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמַ֫יִן</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. pl. heavens (</strong>BH <span dir=\"rtl\">[שָׁמַי]</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁמַיִם</span>, √ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁמה</span><strong>)</strong>;—always emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמַיָּא</span>:<br><strong>1.</strong>  visible <em>sky</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.11\">Je 10:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:8\" href=\"/Daniel.4.8\">Dn 4:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:10\" href=\"/Daniel.4.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:17\" href=\"/Daniel.4.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:19\" href=\"/Daniel.4.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:20\" href=\"/Daniel.4.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:27\" href=\"/Daniel.4.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:28\" href=\"/Daniel.4.28\">28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עוֹף שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:38\" href=\"/Daniel.2.38\">2:38</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">צִפְּרֵי שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:9\" href=\"/Daniel.4.9\">4:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:18\" href=\"/Daniel.4.18\">18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">טַל שׁ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:12\" href=\"/Daniel.4.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:20\" href=\"/Daniel.4.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:22\" href=\"/Daniel.4.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:30\" href=\"/Daniel.4.30\">30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:21\" href=\"/Daniel.5.21\">5:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחֵי שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:2\" href=\"/Daniel.7.2\">7:2</a> <em>winds of the sky;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָנֵי שׁ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:13\" href=\"/Daniel.7.13\">13</a>; <em>heavens</em> + earth = universe <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.11\">Je 10:11</a>, where God shews signs <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:28\" href=\"/Daniel.6.28\">Dn 6:28</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>heavens</em> as abode of God <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:28\" href=\"/Daniel.2.28\">Dn 2:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:31\" href=\"/Daniel.4.31\">4:31</a>, hence, fig., as ruling v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:23\" href=\"/Daniel.4.23\">23</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> sometimes = <em>God</em> in NH J Aram., D<sup>Worte Jesu 179; Eng. Tr. 218 f.</sup>); as abode of angels v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:32\" href=\"/Daniel.4.32\">32</a> (Dr); elsewhere in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלָהּ שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:18\" href=\"/Daniel.2.18\">2:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:19\" href=\"/Daniel.2.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:37\" href=\"/Daniel.2.37\">37</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:44\" href=\"/Daniel.2.44\">44</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:11\" href=\"/Ezra.5.11\">Ezr 5:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:12\" href=\"/Ezra.5.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:9\" href=\"/Ezra.6.9\">6:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:10\" href=\"/Ezra.6.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:12\" href=\"/Ezra.7.12\">7:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:21\" href=\"/Ezra.7.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:23\" href=\"/Ezra.7.23\">23</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">מֶלֶךְ שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:34\" href=\"/Daniel.4.34\">Dn 4:34</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מָרֵא שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:23\" href=\"/Daniel.5.23\">5:23</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁמַם","prev":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁמַד"}